sequenceDiagram
    participant GitHub
    participant CLI
    participant Core
    participant SQLite
    GitHub->>CLI: checkout exact commit
    CLI->>CLI: validate + plan + approval evidence
    CLI->>Core: apply bundle + SHA + digest
    Core->>SQLite: atomic desired-state transaction
    SQLite-->>Core: generation
    Core-->>CLI: operation ID
    CLI->>Core: observe rollout
    Core-->>GitHub: succeeded / failed / degraded
